{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Love, Blades, and Run</i></strong> is a high-mobility parkour game where style is survival and freedom is everything. You play as a masked urban rebel in a city that wants to cage your soul. Run, swing, wall-run, and slash your way through an oppressive regime while uncovering a hidden story of truth, justice, and personal liberation. <br> <br>Feel the movement-driven combat, stylish traversal, and identity-defining choices that shape the full game. Whether you're sprinting across rooftops, dueling enforcers mid-air, or defacing propaganda with your own flair, this is your invitation to rebel\u2014with elegance.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711260?t=1761464622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711260/a458d6096972585389b47ce5cb450e41e7f71040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761464622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711260/1f3093a471cf020aac72c26c5f10d649390390a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761464622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711260/1f3093a471cf020aac72c26c5f10d649390390a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761464622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3722780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Love, Blades, and Run</i></strong> is a high-mobility parkour game where style is survival and freedom is everything. You play as a masked urban rebel in a city that wants to cage your soul. Run, swing, wall-run, and slash your way through an oppressive regime while uncovering a hidden story of truth, justice, and personal liberation. <br> <br>Feel the movement-driven combat, stylish traversal, and identity-defining choices that shape the full game. Whether you're